  "title": "Appraisal settings",
  "entity": "HCMv3.SystemSettings.ManageAppraisalSettings",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>How performance appraisals are run: the cycle, how marks are given and peer review.</p><p>None of these settings is read at present: the features they control were not carried over from the legacy system, so changing them has no effect.</p><p>There is one settings record per company; it cannot be deleted.</p>",
